# Cloudflare Pages environment variables for /api/coach.
# Add these in the Pages dashboard as encrypted secrets/variables.
# Never commit a real API key.

FIREBASE_PROJECT_ID=nowssb-34f1b
COACH_LLM_API_URL=https://api.openai.com/v1/chat/completions
COACH_LLM_API_KEY=replace-with-server-only-provider-key
COACH_LLM_MODEL=gpt-5-mini

# Recommended production smoke test after deployment:
# 1. Sign in at https://nowssb.com.
# 2. Open Personal Coach.
# 3. Send: "I have 10 minutes. What should I practice next?"
# 4. Confirm a real answer appears and remains after closing/reopening.
# 5. Confirm the Start Practice action opens the existing practice flow.
# 6. Remove/blank COACH_LLM_API_KEY in a staging deployment and confirm
#    the client shows a configuration error instead of a canned answer.
